    },
    {
      "id": "105432044",
      "date": "26-11-27 17:27",
      "text": "不用去死磕这个数字",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-6?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105432032",
      "date": "26-11-27 17:27",
      "text": "我也是 每天忙死 都要兼顾",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-6?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105431988",
      "date": "26-11-27 17:26",
      "text": "浪浪，不是已经收盘了嘛，咋跑嘞",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-6?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105421380",
      "date": "26-11-27 15:10",
      "text": "本周围绕国产做了五个案例，结果你们看到了～\n尤其是在上周市场最冰的时候敢于站出来押注方向的人，都是大心脏者\n同时分享了五个知识点，一难四易：\n1.情绪周期四阶段\n2.五维判断情绪冷热\n3.分歧与一致，硬币的正反面\n4.断板反包的高低位拆解\n5.寻龙分金看缠山\n周末我就开始圆辅导下周的五个知识点，稍微提高一下系统难度，就从B反怎么判断开始。\n最冰的时候我没离开你们，今天也是一样，希望下周各位都有一个好结果，共勉，周末愉快。\n有问题留言，我晚点回复。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-8?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105420688",
      "date": "26-11-27 15:06",
      "text": "@齁币多\n，关于两个月，你补充",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-8?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105418716",
      "date": "26-11-27 14:50",
      "text": "其实还有一点，你接着补充吧，为啥我要今天说两个月",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-8?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105415410",
      "date": "26-11-27 14:18",
      "text": "精彩一幕",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-9?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105414691",
      "date": "26-11-27 14:13",
      "text": "感动想哭？",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-9?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105413256",
      "date": "26-11-27 13:59",
      "text": "算了\n读一遍我今天早上圆宝早盘第一句吧",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-9?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105413212",
      "date": "26-11-27 13:58",
      "text": "不急",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-10?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105412191",
      "date": "26-11-27 13:49",
      "text": "因为你清仓了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-10?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105409919",
      "date": "26-11-27 13:29",
      "text": "我观察了一下波动率，只有双创的波动率是上升的，其他的都是横，甚至下跌的\n同时我再告诉你们，\n科创50\n是某队这次捡的最多的",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-11?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105407570",
      "date": "26-11-27 13:09",
      "text": "新闻呀 你没看吗",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-12?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105406822",
      "date": "26-11-27 13:00",
      "text": "中午的利好，你们怎么看",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-12?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105406671",
      "date": "26-11-27 12:57",
      "text": "黄线很重要 没错",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-13?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105405195",
      "date": "26-11-27 12:31",
      "text": "不让说\n我问问吧",
      "images": [
        "https://css.tgb.cn/images/face/011.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-13?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105404907",
      "date": "26-11-27 12:26",
      "text": "大概明白\n然后就导致你的心态越来越差，动作也就扭曲了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-14?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105404426",
      "date": "26-11-27 12:16",
      "text": "国产呀\n我说了好久了\n我等收盘写吧",
      "images": [
        "https://css.tgb.cn/images/face/011.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-14?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105404352",
      "date": "26-11-27 12:15",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哥你笑死我了",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-14?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105404177",
      "date": "26-11-27 12:11",
      "text": "你太悲观了 就会这样",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-14?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105404163",
      "date": "26-11-27 12:11",
      "text": "好家伙，上海王中王回归",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-15?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105403675",
      "date": "26-11-27 12:01",
      "text": "牛逼！下周继续",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-15?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105403658",
      "date": "26-11-27 12:01",
      "text": "牛逼！",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-15?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105401326",
      "date": "26-11-27 11:30",
      "text": "算了 没意思\n冰点之际敢于发声的没几个人",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-16?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105400603",
      "date": "26-11-27 11:23",
      "text": "上周五：为众人抱薪者，不可使其冻毙于风雪。\n最回头看看我当时这句话吧！",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-16?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105398370",
      "date": "26-11-27 11:01",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈我们就是发图片表情包",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-17?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105398044",
      "date": "26-11-27 10:58",
      "text": "好运向来顾及你",
      "images": [
        "https://css.tgb.cn/images/face/005.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-17?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105397675",
      "date": "26-11-27 10:54",
      "text": "xys啊。。。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-17?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105397398",
      "date": "26-11-27 10:52",
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        "https://css.tgb.cn/images/face/002.png",
        "https://css.tgb.cn/images/face/002.png",
        "https://css.tgb.cn/images/face/002.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-18?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105396667",
      "date": "26-11-27 10:46",
      "text": "兄弟们，助伦总一把",
      "images": [
        "https://image.tgb.cn/img/2026/11/27/bhgu0htgmr2o.png_760w.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-18?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105396108",
      "date": "26-11-27 10:41",
      "text": "不容易啊伦总",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-18?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105395742",
      "date": "26-11-27 10:37",
      "text": "银行\n回落，指数向上\n看量能能否突破临界点",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-19?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105394450",
      "date": "26-11-27 10:26",
      "text": "damn！",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-19?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105394422",
      "date": "26-11-27 10:26",
      "text": "我就说一条龙的，有涨停可以拿，没毛病",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-19?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105392596",
      "date": "26-11-27 10:11",
      "text": "giao",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-20?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105392375",
      "date": "26-11-27 10:09",
      "text": "正文最后一句话，超短，稳定是唯一的护城河。\n这周希望你们有所体会哈，我对思路负责，你们对自己负责，各位有缘的同学们能理解吗",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-20?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105391527",
      "date": "26-11-27 10:00",
      "text": "？",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-20?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105391493",
      "date": "26-11-27 09:59",
      "text": "大概懂你意思了，这么说吧，如果控住了，第二天和你也没关系了；如果控不住，那也和你没关系\n真正好的思路是在左左侧，思考下",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-20?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105391382",
      "date": "26-11-27 09:58",
      "text": "高位这里新华还封着，但我猜封不住，况且新华的一字没有带动板块，看芒果和果麦就能知道\n整体看，老周期有点弱势了，后面可以把注意力放在顺势，较新的品种，主力资金这里也在等一个顺势契机，卡指数阳线，可以类比11月4日的那种。",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-20?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105390215",
      "date": "26-11-27 09:44",
      "text": "啥意思 我没理解",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-21?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105389368",
      "date": "26-11-27 09:30",
      "text": "【竞价异动】\n昇腾：\n常山北明\n，\n骏亚科技\n超三千家红蓝，预测量能继续萎靡至8000亿",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-21?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105388257",
      "date": "26-11-27 09:11",
      "text": "@齁币多\n，你看人家多明白",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-22?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105388230",
      "date": "26-11-27 09:11",
      "text": "哪里不懂",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-22?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105388192",
      "date": "26-11-27 09:10",
      "text": "杀猪刀",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-22?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105386761",
      "date": "26-11-27 08:45",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-23?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105385577",
      "date": "26-11-27 08:04",
      "text": "那咋办呀",
      "images": [],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-24?type=new"
    },
    {
      "id": "105385348",
      "date": "26-11-27 07:45",
      "text": "【11.27圆宝早盘】\n大局观：我看了看新节点图，大概知道指数什么时候开始B反了，希望你们抓到这个机会~今年所有的炒作，如果去对比去年的，相当于全部提前了2个月，这句很重要。\n指数层面：除了\n科创50\n以外没有新低，其他都新低了，科创50内部的是国产科技的机构票居多，连续补跌，如果今天惯性下探创出新低，彼时要观察所有指数的协同性。\n情绪端：以席位为主，彩色席位是老超跌的海洋，紫色席位是冰山，黄色席位是北纬，当席位溢价从龙头开始无限外溢，就是第三阶段了。\n题材端：低位国产和高位老抱团各自走各自的，内在也是辩证逻辑，低位在等契机，高位同时又会压制低位，最坏的结果是一起退，最好的结果昨天早盘思路已经讲过，这时候就需要你主观选边站。\n最后，下周一是本月的最后一天，我又要说出我那句耳熟能详的话了，换月如？你们自己在心里接。\n就这些，今天的早盘非常简单明晰，八字箴言【换月在即，提前推演】！如果你也认可那就打下八个字发在评论区吧～点点赞，有好运哦",
      "images": [
        "https://css.tgb.cn/images/face/024.png"
      ],
      "source_url": "https://m.tgb.cn/a/2x2RBFZEnZ7-25?type=new"
    }
  ],
